{"id":51872,"date":"2026-06-30T07:45:55","date_gmt":"2026-06-30T06:45:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trofeu-ctr-viver-santarem\/"},"modified":"2026-08-21T18:30:24","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T17:30:24","slug":"trofeu-ctr-viver-santarem","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trofeu-ctr-viver-santarem\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO TRAIL CTR VIVER SANTAR\u00c9M 2026 --><\/p>\n<p><!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre o <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026 com partida no Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m (Santar\u00e9m). Etapa oficial do Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR) com cronometragem no Trilho Perdido, contempla Trail de 31 km, Trail Sprint de 19 km, Mini Trail de 10 km e Kids Race. Explora os nossos guias de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">trail running<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-santarem\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas em Santar\u00e9m<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\/ Snapshot<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>13 de setembro de 2026 (08h30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m (Santar\u00e9m)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>31 km (Trail), 19 km (Sprint), 10 km (Mini) e Kids Race<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Trilhos do Valado, Encostas de Santar\u00e9m e Margens do Tejo<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prova &amp; Percurso<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O circuito de 31 km combina vales profundos ribatejanos e subidas acentuadas \u00e0s Portas do Sol.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 4. BANNER CALCULADORA --><\/p>\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important; color: #C4B5FD !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; padding: 10px 20px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span><br \/>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<p>    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<p>  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 5. ALOJAMENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ficar em Santar\u00e9m (Alojamento)<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Santar\u00e9m Centro:<\/strong> Hot\u00e9is perto do Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico e no centro hist\u00f3rico de Santar\u00e9m.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Sopa da Pedra de Almeirim, Magusto com Assado Ribatejano e Celestes de Santar\u00e9m.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 7. FAQS --><\/p>\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre o Trail CTR Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026.<\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>Os resultados oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis no Trilho Perdido, CTR e no Portugal Running.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n<p>As fotos s\u00e3o partilhadas no Trilho Perdido e Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51873,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-51872","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-santarem","event_type-trail","even